{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Cross-reference from nosophobic-zebraic-waterbug (0df8-9ee6-24a6-4c39), which recorded an MCP `stale-store: 19 commit(s) BEHIND` refusal on transition_ticket while `store_freshness()` and `git rev-list --count HEAD..origin/tickets` both reported fresh. That ticket's root cause (linked-worktree config read from the main checkout: `_main_worktree_tracker` and `push.py` resolving config from the store's parent) does not explain it: `pending_init_is_symlink` returns False unless `.git` is a file, and an MCP server running from a main checkout has a `.git` directory. The stale-store observation is handed to this ticket; not verified as the same divergence."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793533177231779001,"uuid":"191e032f-159c-4b8c-b2a1-6efc5e275a05"}